{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"content_hash":"fa2938c365cfcecc2e2fe645b0c737e7d4fc30b6ae61666b58ed501073bcdb8f","digest":{"component_or_area":"bug lifecycle and provenance linking","key_entities":["src/rebar/metrics/blame.py","src/rebar/_commands/transition_close.py","src/rebar/_commands/transition.py","src/rebar/_lib_writes.py","src/rebar/_commands/verify_commit.py","src/rebar/_links.py","tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_caused_by_autoderive.py","tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_caused_by_autoderive_heldout.py","rebar-ticket trailer","file_impact","caused_by relation","_write_link_event","rebar transition","--caused-by param","--class param","docs/user-guide.md"],"problem_keywords":["blame-based auto-derivation","caused_by link","bug close","culprit resolution","git blame","rebar-ticket trailer","single-culprit threshold","closed-source guard bypass"],"propositions":["On bug close, auto-derive a best-effort caused_by link to the culprit commit via git blame, resolving the commit to a ticket via rebar-ticket trailer.","The blame resolver applies a strict >50% single-culprit majority threshold across file_impact files; ambiguous cases or multi-commit spreads return None and skip auto-linking.","The auto-link runs after the bug is closed and writes via _write_link_event directly, bypassing the closed-source guard that would otherwise reject links from closed sources.","A --caused-by <id> parameter allows explicit override or manual specification when auto-derivation is unavailable or ambiguous.","The public library facade transition() must thread caused_by to transition_compute to enable library callers to set caused_by on close."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_diges